  %% Target design: docs/reference/tasks.md#complete-and-cleanup. Orchestrator 2026-11-08: keeping approved work is a precondition of completion, not a step of it. Orchestrator 2026-11-14: a task copy goes through its normal instance.destroy, as on cancel. 2026-11-16 (group 5615): a copy group whose committed work is on the default branch completes without an ended watched pull request (a hand-carry); the copy's content read decides, and an empty group still needs cancel. 2026-11-16 (group 5615, subtask 2): complete reads the copy first and never destroys one that holds uncommitted, untracked, stashed or other-branch work; a copy group whose watched pull request merged completes by itself from the task:copy-settle tick, in every Project. 2026-11-15: the task VMs and their release are removed (docs/reference/old-paths.md).
